    {"id":"s01","type":"environment_character","duration":6,"environment":"kitchen_01","character":"male_01","props":["microwave_01"],"caption":"WHY SO SLOW?","narration":"Thirty seconds on a microwave can feel strangely long, especially when you stand there watching every number change.","beats":[{"at_pct":0.05,"at":0.3,"motion":"walk","target":"male_01"},{"at_pct":0.25,"at":1.5,"motion":"highlight","target":"microwave_01"},{"at_pct":0.48,"at":2.88,"motion":"pop","target":"timer"},{"at_pct":0.72,"at":4.32,"motion":"slow_zoom","target":"microwave_01"}]},
    {"id":"s02","type":"environment_overlay","duration":6,"environment":"kitchen_01","character":"male_01","props":["microwave_01"],"caption":"YOU NOTICE EVERY SECOND","narration":"The timer is not actually slower. Your attention is locked onto time, so every single second gets noticed.","beats":[{"at_pct":0.05,"at":0.3,"motion":"fade_in","target":"attention_overlay"},{"at_pct":0.28,"at":1.68,"motion":"track","target":"timer"},{"at_pct":0.52,"at":3.12,"motion":"pop","target":"second_markers"},{"at_pct":0.76,"at":4.56,"motion":"punch_zoom","target":"timer"}]},
    {"id":"s03","type":"behavior_comparison","duration":6,"environment":"kitchen_01","character":"male_01","props":["microwave_01"],"caption":"WATCHING vs DISTRACTED","narration":"Compare that with scrolling your phone. Your attention keeps jumping, and half a minute can disappear before you notice.","beats":[{"at_pct":0.05,"at":0.3,"motion":"split_reveal","target":"comparison"},{"at_pct":0.28,"at":1.68,"motion":"highlight","target":"timer_side"},{"at_pct":0.52,"at":3.12,"motion":"float","target":"phone_side"},{"at_pct":0.78,"at":4.68,"motion":"pan_right","target":"phone_side"}]},
    {"id":"s04","type":"character_closeup","duration":6,"environment":"kitchen_01","character":"male_01","props":["microwave_01"],"caption":"THE REWARD IS COMING","narration":"Waiting also removes uncertainty. You know exactly when the reward is coming, which makes the countdown hard to ignore.","beats":[{"at_pct":0.05,"at":0.3,"motion":"slow_zoom","target":"male_01"},{"at_pct":0.3,"at":1.8,"motion":"pop","target":"reward_label"},{"at_pct":0.55,"at":3.3,"motion":"track","target":"timer"},{"at_pct":0.78,"at":4.68,"motion":"highlight","target":"microwave_01"}]},
    {"id":"s05","type":"environment_summary","duration":6,"environment":"kitchen_01","character":"male_01","props":["microwave_01"],"caption":"STOP WATCHING THE TIMER","narration":"So if thirty seconds feels eternal, stop staring at the timer. Apparently, watched microwaves age in dog years.","beats":[{"at_pct":0.05,"at":0.3,"motion":"pan_left","target":"male_01"},{"at_pct":0.28,"at":1.68,"motion":"pop","target":"look_away"},{"at_pct":0.55,"at":3.3,"motion":"highlight","target":"timer"},{"at_pct":0.8,"at":4.8,"motion":"punch_zoom","target":"punchline"}]}
